1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,950
Distributor se maal aaya hai.

2
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:17,812
Purchases screen par supplier ka bill do tarah
se daal sakte hain: bill ki file upload karke,

3
00:00:17,852 --> 00:00:19,510
ya haath se type karke.

4
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,502
Abhi hum bill type karenge.

5
00:00:22,245 --> 00:00:23,522
Supplier chuniye.

6
00:00:23,562 --> 00:00:26,929
Naya supplier ho to naam likhkar Add kijiye.

7
00:00:26,969 --> 00:00:31,421
Phir supplier ka bill number aur bill ki
taareekh daaliye.

8
00:00:32,188 --> 00:00:33,460
Ab items jodiye.

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:40,348
Medicine khojiye, aur har line par batch number,
expiry, packs ki ginti, free packs,

10
00:00:40,388 --> 00:00:43,382
GST se pehle ki rate aur MRP bhariye.

11
00:00:43,422 --> 00:00:48,793
Yeh wahi nayi medicine hai jo humne pichhle part
mein banaayi thi.

12
00:00:49,544 --> 00:00:52,617
Doosri line: Paracip 650 ka naya batch.

13
00:00:52,657 --> 00:00:56,608
Free packs ka matlab scheme mein mili muft
strips,

14
00:00:56,648 --> 00:01:00,679
jo stock mein judti hain par unka paisa nahi
lagta.

15
00:01:01,422 --> 00:01:05,499
Neeche bill ka total GST sahit apne-aap banta
hai.

16
00:01:05,539 --> 00:01:09,121
GST har medicine ke GST rate se nikalta hai.

17
00:01:09,161 --> 00:01:15,378
Supplier ke bill se total milaaiye, phir 'Save
bill and add stock' dabaaiye.

18
00:01:15,418 --> 00:01:18,672
Yahi aapka goods receipt, yaani GRN hai.

19
00:01:19,426 --> 00:01:23,634
Stock turant badh gaya, naye batch aur expiry ke
saath.

20
00:01:23,674 --> 00:01:26,879
Supplier ka bakaaya bhi apne-aap jud gaya.

21
00:01:27,890 --> 00:01:31,346
Supplier ko payment Accounts screen se hota hai.

22
00:01:31,386 --> 00:01:35,643
'Suppliers to pay' mein har supplier ka bakaaya
dikhta hai.

23
00:01:35,683 --> 00:01:39,795
Amount, mode aur UTR ya cheque number daalkar
Pay kijiye.

24
00:01:42,923 --> 00:01:49,031
Payment hote hi bakaaya kam ho jaata hai, aur
entry cash book ya bank mein chali jaati hai.

25
00:01:49,071 --> 00:01:53,085
Supplier ko maal waapas bhejna ho, ya expiry
claim karna ho,

26
00:01:53,125 --> 00:01:56,869
to Supplier tools mein Claims aur return ke
vikalp hain.

27
00:02:02,930 --> 00:02:06,075
Har bill haath se type karna zaroori nahi.

28
00:02:06,115 --> 00:02:12,824
Zyaadatar distributors apna bill e-bill file
mein bhi dete hain, CSV, Excel ya text mein.

29
00:02:12,864 --> 00:02:17,904
Supplier tools ki E-bill import se yeh file
seedhe padhi jaati hai.

30
00:02:18,654 --> 00:02:26,831
Ek zaroori baat: PDF ya photo wale bill ko scan
karne wala AI feature Medoro server par OCR
engine se chalta hai.

31
00:02:26,871 --> 00:02:30,031
Is demo server par OCR engine juda nahi hai,

32
00:02:30,071 --> 00:02:33,813
isliye yahan hum e-bill file import dikha rahe
hain.

33
00:02:34,582 --> 00:02:40,088
Pehle supplier chuniye, phir 'Choose bill file'
se distributor ki file chuniye.

34
00:02:40,128 --> 00:02:44,792
Hamaare paas Jharkhand Medical Agencies ki ek
demo e-bill file hai.

35
00:02:45,552 --> 00:02:52,103
Medoro file ke columns pehchaanta hai: item ka
naam, batch, expiry, quantity,

36
00:02:52,143 --> 00:02:54,927
free quantity, rate, MRP aur GST.

37
00:02:54,967 --> 00:02:59,635
Har line ko catalogue ki medicine se milaaya
jaata hai.

38
00:03:00,398 --> 00:03:03,342
Post karne se pehle review zaroori hai.

39
00:03:03,382 --> 00:03:10,153
Har line ki medicine, batch, expiry, maatra aur
rate supplier ke kaagzi bill se milaaiye.

40
00:03:10,193 --> 00:03:16,198
Koi medicine na mile, to use sahi medicine se
jodiye ya nayi medicine banaaiye.

41
00:03:16,947 --> 00:03:20,452
Sab sahi ho to bill number daalkar save kijiye.

42
00:03:20,492 --> 00:03:25,883
Stock, batches aur supplier ka bakaaya, teeno ek
saath update hote hain.

43
00:03:31,948 --> 00:03:35,799
Suppliers ki jaankari Medoro mein purchase bills
se banti hai.

44
00:03:35,839 --> 00:03:41,009
Accounts screen par 'Suppliers to pay' mein har
supplier ka kul bakaaya dikhta hai.

45
00:03:41,766 --> 00:03:46,572
Har supplier ke aage payment form hai: amount,
mode, jaise cash,

46
00:03:46,612 --> 00:03:50,357
bank transfer ya cheque, aur UTR ya cheque
number.

47
00:03:50,397 --> 00:03:55,203
Pay dabaate hi payment voucher banta hai aur
bakaaya ghatta hai.

48
00:03:55,948 --> 00:04:02,041
Supplier tools mein Pricing tab har medicine ki
supplier-wise khareed dar dikhata hai,

49
00:04:02,081 --> 00:04:07,032
sabse sasta supplier pehle, saath mein landed
cost aur MRP par margin.

50
00:04:07,072 --> 00:04:11,382
Isse pata chalta hai ki agla order kisse lena
faaydemand hai.

51
00:04:12,137 --> 00:04:20,269
Claims tab mein expiry ke kareeb ka maal
supplier ko waapas karne ya credit note lene ka
hisaab rehta hai: kitne din bache,

52
00:04:20,309 --> 00:04:22,661
kitna claim kiya, kitna credit mila.

53
00:04:23,409 --> 00:04:28,369
Aur Cheques screen par suppliers ko diye gaye
post-dated cheques ka record rehta hai,

54
00:04:28,409 --> 00:04:30,545
taaki clearing ki taareekh yaad rahe.

55
00:04:31,293 --> 00:04:36,510
Dhyan dein: is device counter par supplier ki
alag profile, poora supplier ledger

56
00:04:36,550 --> 00:04:40,923
aur statement ki screen abhi nahi hai; supplier
ka bakaaya, payments

57
00:04:40,963 --> 00:04:44,881
aur purchase bills upar dikhaaye gaye screens
par milte hain.
